Subject: [PATCH] apollo 1107: Novatek NT36675 touch (host firmware download
 over GENI SPI SE4), nvttouch=1

---
 bsd/conf/files       |   1 +
 bsd/dev/apollo_nvt.c | 752 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 bsd/dev/sweet_ufs.c  |   2 +
 3 files changed, 755 insertions(+)
